{"id":"wb-6-977","name":"青岛啤酒厂早期建筑","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"青岛啤酒博物馆","text":"青岛啤酒博物馆，位于中华人民共和国山东省青岛市市北区登州路，是在国家重点文物保护单位青岛啤酒厂早期建筑的基础上建设而成的中国第一家以啤酒为主题的的博物馆，同时是国家4A级旅游景区、国家一级博物馆、国家首批工农业旅游示范点。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9D%92%E5%B2%9B%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86","revisionId":94319305,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94319305","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/75d3bb817c029ab54ba2c19e.jpg","title":"Tsingdao_Brewery.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tsingdao_Brewery.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Tsingdao_Brewery.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"M. Weitzel","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","caption":"​青岛啤酒工厂","width":320,"height":240}}